 "plan_about": "The four daily slots (Yarin, 11 Nov 2026: 'retime everything based on the findings, i need 4 posting hours a day ... enough gap ... not to feel spammy'). Keys are weekdays, 0 = Sunday. Roles: kid = the child-voice carousel, test = the test batch carousel, reel_a = the first reel (option א), reel_b = the second (option ב). Built from follower_active: 06:00 to 09:00 is only 60 to 70% of a day's peak (30% on Saturday), so nothing is planned before 09:00; carousels and reels alternate through the day, at least 3 hours apart (min_gap_minutes); the strongest blocks get the child-voice carousel and a reel. Sun to Thu: 09:30 test, 13:30 reel, 18:30 kid, 21:30 reel. Friday (peak 15:00 to 18:00, evening drops): 09:00, 12:00, 15:00, 18:30. Saturday (weak morning, strong 18:00 to 24:00): 12:30 reel, 15:30 test, 18:30 reel, 21:30 kid. Not measured: the best hour inside a 3 hour block, and Facebook. Posts already queued in Postiz keep their time until Yarin says to replace them.",
